    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "<color=#F3D603>Winning Conditions</color>\n+ <b>EVEN</b>: if the total red or white buttons having in the result is an Even number.\n+ <b>ODD</b>: if the total red or white buttons having in the result is an Odd number.\n+ Other bet options as <img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/>, <img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/>, <img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/>, <img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_white\" offset=-4/><img src=\"dot_red\" offset=-4/>: if the outcome matches the player’s bet, the player wins. ",
